[1]5GC002574_A_TC_04_Cellsetup_w_Coord_Update_Ind_10MHz_DL_ratio_max_70_95_w_superfast_allocation
   [Tags]    FULL_RUN    Cellsetup     10MHZ    2574   2574_A1      MYCRT
   [Documentation]     Cellsetup Dss phase 3, BW= 10MHz, DL RATIO = 100%, CellSetup with CatM activated
   ...                 DL Coordination Req/Rsp and DL Coordination Update Ind test scenario case
   ...                 Check CPRT CatM activation with superfast allocation activated
