   ...                            Teardown 2574      alias=egate_TC4    AND
   ...                            set Suite Variable  ${testCaseDir}  None


# TC covered under New Feature
# [1]5GC002574-A1_TC7_Cellsetup_SANSA_10MHz_DL_ratio_max_70_95_Failure_Case_DL_Cell_Alloc_Req_wo_CATMInfoReceived
[1]5GC002574-A1_TC7_Cellsetup_SANSA_10MHz_DL_ratio_max_70_95_Failure_Case_DL_Cell_Alloc_Req_wo_CATMInfoReceived
   [Tags]    FULL_RUN    CellsetupFailureCase     10MHZ    2574   2574_A1     MYCRT
   [Documentation]     Cellsetup Dss phase 3, BW= 10MHz, DL RATIO = 70%, gNB doesn t receive CAT-M Info in Allocation
   ...                      request whereas CATM-M feature is activated at gNB
   ...                 [actLteNrDssLteCatM == 'true']: check that IE DL PRB Allocation Info.Extension 01 is contained.
   ...                                                 Check that PRB area C/D for SIB1-BR Subframes are present if and only
   ...                                                 chBwDl is larger than 10MHz     => a revoir
   ...            When L2-PS receives a EN_DSS_DL_CELL_RESOURCE_AREA_ALLOCATION_REQUEST with Extension_01 and it doesnt received yet CatMinfo in
   ...            PsCell_DssCellCrmClientCfgReq (during DL Coordination) received from CP-RT, L2-PS answers
   ...             EN_DSS_DL_CELL_RESOURCE_AREA_ALLOCATION_FAILURE with EN DSS Failure Cause (Subcarrier AllocationFailure)
   [Setup]   Run Keywords    set Suite Variable    ${testCaseDir}    None      AND
   ...                       common_Dss_Keywords.Get testcase log directory

   ${tc_name}    Set variable    TestLine_preparation
   ${tc_status}    getTcStatusByName    name=${tc_name}
   ${msg}   Catenate   "2574_DSS_Cellsetup: sw release used [${convert_version}], Cellsetup Dss phase 3
   ...          BW= 10MHz, DL RATIO = 100%"
   common_Dss_Keywords.Log Test description   ${msg}
   Run keyword if    '${tc_status}'!='PASS'
   ...           5GC002574_Kw_TestSetup.Test Line Preparation    ${TestDSS10Mhz_2574_A1}
   ${tc_name}    Set variable    TestLine_2574_Test_setup_10Mhz
   ${tc_status}    getTcStatusByName    name=${tc_name}
   Run keyword if    '${tc_status}'!='PASS'
   ...           5GC002574_Kw_TestSetup.Test Setup 2574    ${TestDSS10Mhz_2574_A1}

   # desactivate superfast_allocation in scf and Param context (used during CellSetup)
   Set 2574 Specifc Scf Param actLteNrDssFastAlloc with "false" value and update into "${TestDSS10Mhz_2574_A1}"

   # to remove later as CatM will be activated by default
   Set 2574 Specifc Scf Param actLteNrDssLteCatM with "true" value and update into "${TestDSS10Mhz_2574_A1}"

   5GC002574_keywords.TC 2574 CellSetup wo CRM CatM Config         ${TestDSS10Mhz_2574_A1}   egate_TC7

   ${output}=    nps_2574_tools.Verify QC Test Case    verify_5GC002574_activation
   should contain	                ${output}	                            passed

   [Teardown]      Run Keywords    Teardown 2574      alias=egate_TC7     AND
   ...                             set Suite Variable  ${testCaseDir}  None

